The '''Advent Calendar''' is a system whereby the player can claim rewards during the 25 days of [[w:Advent|Advent]]. The '''Advent Calendar''' can be accessed through the {{Item|SkyBlock Menu}}. Players with ranks receive extra cosmetic items.

